# Outreach / contact lists / Slack exports are intentionally NOT in this public
# repo. A local-only copy lives at ~/Desktop/doctrine-labs/outreach-scratch/
# for private use. The check-public-content.js hook will block any docs/outreach/
# folder or contact-list content from being committed.

# RUN_OUTPUT.md is generated but deliberately committed: the point of the tool
# is a shareable artifact, so a reader should see the output without running it.
# Reports are path-relative and timestamp-free so they diff cleanly.

# Aliases created by human-accepted model proposals. Local state, not source.
docs/epistemic/*/aliases.json

# Your recorded positions on adjudicated conclusions. Yours, local, and not
# something a cloned repo should carry back upstream.
decisions/*.json

# Local preview / scratch
.preview-*.png
*.log

# FLF's own competition brief and judging criteria. Kept locally for reference;
# not ours to republish from a public repository.
docs/competition/
.git-replace-text.txt

# AISI snapshot — generated, not edited. Regenerate via:
#   node data/aisi/scripts/snapshot.js
